  "title": "Thai-Style Fragrant Rice",
  "description": "This fragrant rice dish is a great accompaniment to any stir-fry or meat dish you can concoct. Rice is simmered with coconut milk and fresh curry and basil leaves to give a terrific option to simple rice.",
